WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.640
kevin, you're completely helpless

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.520
[Jeff] Kevin, you are SUCH a disease!

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:08.840
[Kevin] I wish they would all just disappear....

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.260
[Dramatic string rising]

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.140
[Kate] KEVIN!

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:12.920
[Sinister sounds]

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:13.780
[Kate, distorted] Kevin...

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:18.020
I made my family disappear.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.080
[Megan] Kevin, you're completely helpless.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.000
[Jeff] You are SUCH a disease.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.640
[Frank] You little jerk!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.040
[highly distorted] Completely disappear...

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:26.960
[Kate] You should ask Santa for a new family.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.580
[Knife flings]
[Kate, distorted] KEVIN!!

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.440
[Blood squelching]

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.540
[Slowed] ...Made my family disappear.

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:34.460
[Echoes]

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:37.140
[Bricks scraping on stone]

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.140
[Blood squelching and dripping]

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:42.200
[Ominous music starts]

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.080
[Engine rattling]

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:45.640
[Harry] Here it is, Marv..

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.120
[Marv] Wow! who knew you could get such a nice place on Airbnb?

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:51.460
-Yeah, she's okay. [chuckles]

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.400
The owner said to give him a call when we arrived.

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:55.280
[Beeping]

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.260
[Kevin] Yes?

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:59.020
-Hey there, this is Harry with the Airbnb reservation?

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:02.420
Hey, we're just pulling up now, is it still all right if we let ourselves in?

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:03.120
-Yes.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:08.840
[Ominous music intensifies]

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:11.280
[Harry yawns]

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:13.020
Actually we made pretty good time!

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:16.360
Uhh let's see here..Uh you're downstairs, I'm up, right?

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.500
[Marv] D-d-downstairs? [grumbles]

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:23.560
Screw this, I'm going upstairs. I'll sleep on the couch if I have to.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:25.480
Wish I got a dang hotel..

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:27.140
I hate Airbnb!

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:29.680
AURGH!!

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:30.880
[Screams in pain]

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:32.140
[Flesh tearing and crunching]

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:35.020
[Continues screaming]

00:01:35.060 --> 00:01:37.440
[Harry] Ooh, place looks just like the pictures.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:38.580
[Flame whooses]

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:42.540
[Screams in burning horror]

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:43.980
[Eyes pop apart]

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:46.360
[Grunts]

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:53.460
URGHH!

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:57.300
[Marv gurgling and blood dripping]

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:00.700
[Mark whistles] This is where we're stayin'?

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:04.640
Hah, this is gonna be the best Twin Brothers Convention ever!

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:08.360
[Larry] Sure is! Looks like Harry and Marv already got the party started too!

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:10.640
[Mark] Say, who the hell is that?

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:12.940
[Dramatic strings start]

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:15.340
[Larry] All good parties start in the backdoor, am I right, Mark?!

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.460
[Larry tapping on the window] Helloo??

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:19.800
[Mark] Hey, the key's not under the mat!

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:22.340
Ah, it's okay. I can fit through here!

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:23.900
[Mark grunts and grumbles]

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:25.400
[Music intensifies and comes to a stop]

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:26.140
[Inaudible]

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:26.980
W-w-waai-

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:27.960
[ANNIHILATED]

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.600
[Larry ] AAAAHH! OH WHAT- MARK WHAT THE HE-

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:32.200
AAAAHHHAHAHGHGH

00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:34.920
Don't get scared now.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.020
[Police sirens closing in]

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:38.920
[Tires screeching]

00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:42.620
[Police on megaphone] Drop the gun! Come out with your hands up!

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.060
We have the place surrounded!

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:49.600
[Police radio] [Unintelligible]
Uhh shots fired..

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:53.360
[Police sirens wailing]

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.540
[Police on megaphone] We have the place surrounded!

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:58.540
Drop the gun, and come on out!

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:00.540
[Officer] GO GO GO GO GO

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:10.520
[Jake] Did you like this video?

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:13.820
Good! Cuz we have a whole show, called the 'Corridor Crew' show.

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:15.720
Where we make content like this,

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:18.640
and we go into detail on how we make it, and the fun that we have doing it.

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:21.060
We made a video, for this, that is on that channel.

00:03:21.060 --> 00:03:23.820
We also did one called; "Making Marvel Rated R".

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:26.540
So, consider checking them out, people seemed to have a lot of fun.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.000
[Clicks tongue] Thanks for watching.

